    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44687" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐπαρα-μύθητος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῡ],
