				</span></i>
			 (dub. l.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				4.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>easily proved</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
